    "stop_reason": "success",
    "result_text": "The change is complete and all tests pass (BUILD SUCCESS, 2/2 tests green \u2014 the suite's only concrete test class is `AcceptanceTest`).\n\n## What I did\n\nThe `membershipTier` is a read-only, derived field on the owner read model. I implemented it in the two places that shape that model:\n\n1. **`src/main/resources/openapi.yml`** \u2014 added a `membershipTier` string property to the `Owner` schema. Since the DTOs are generated from this spec at build time, this creates the `membershipTier` field on `OwnerDto` (surfacing in the `GET /api/owners/{id}` JSON response the tests assert on).\n\n2. **`src/main/java/.../mapper/OwnerMapper.java`** \u2014 added a MapStruct `@Mapping` expression alongside the existing `displayName`/`initials` derivations to compute the tier:\n   - `SILVER` when `namesakeCount == 0` **and** an email is present (non-null, non-blank)\n   - `BRONZE` otherwise\n\nThe two acceptance tests confirm both branches: `coreSilverWhenUniqueWithEmail` (unique owner + email \u2192 SILVER) and `functionalityBronzeWhenNoEmail` (no email \u2192 BRONZE).",
